CORE
negative-part-select-width2.sv
--bound 1
^file .* line 9: width of indexed part select must be positive$
^EXIT=2$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^\[main\.p0\]
--
1800-2017 11.5.1: the width expr2 of an indexed part-select
"expr1 +: expr2" / "expr1 -: expr2" shall be a *positive* constant
expression.  Zero is not positive, so v[3 +: 0] (and v[3 -: 0]) is
illegal and must be rejected exactly like a negative width.
